Package: melbfoot
Title: Find High-Traffic Locations for a Melbourne CBD Pop-Up Store
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
   person("Anali", "Nanayakkara", , "anan0016@student.monash.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides hourly pedestrian counts from the City of Melbourne
    Pedestrian Counting System, summarised by sensor, weekday and hour, along
    with sensor locations. Includes a function that ranks locations by foot
    traffic within a chosen trading window and a Shiny app that helps someone
    planning a clothing pop-up compare candidate locations.
